+ * reported 0 LE advertisements for 256 s while the same 200b/200c bytes without it gave 13 per 20 s [obs bt-up14, docs/reviews/T-4ee1-proof.md]. On bluetoothd's tx stream
+ * (sbu_tx_kctl only) whole `01 e9 fc` packets with sub-op 05 or 07 are held back from the chip (fewer bytes reach the chip, no new store) and bluetoothd gets the Command
